[36m(TaskRunner pid=113897)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=113897)[0m First scenario:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=113897)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=113897)[0m - Walking speed: s km/h
[36m(TaskRunner pid=113897)[0m - Total time: 4 hours (includes t minutes in the coffee shop)
