[36m(TaskRunner pid=113897)[0m Second scenario:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=113897)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=113897)[0m - Walking speed: s + 2 km/h
[36m(TaskRunner pid=113897)[0m - Total time: 2 hours and 24 minutes. 24 minutes is 24/60 = 0.4 hours, so total time is 2.4 hours.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=113897)[0m - Walking time: 2.4 - t hours
[36m(TaskRunner pid=113897)[0m - Distance covered: 9 km
[36m(TaskRunner pid=113897)[0m 
